  <div><a name="_0cedd963-6b61-8509-5cd0-670c71851ff3_ITU_G.650" id="_0cedd963-6b61-8509-5cd0-670c71851ff3_ITU_G.650"></a>
    <h1>3.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Definitions</h1>
    <div><a name="_62f93c85-2d30-6b66-efbd-eb5265f09002_ITU_G.650" id="_62f93c85-2d30-6b66-efbd-eb5265f09002_ITU_G.650"></a><h2>3.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Terms defined elsewhere</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2cb75602-135c-f103-a832-9261baf496e1_ITU_G.650" id="_2cb75602-135c-f103-a832-9261baf496e1_ITU_G.650"></a>This Recommendation uses the following terms defined elsewhere:</p>
<div><a name="term-playlist_ITU_G.650" id="term-playlist_ITU_G.650"></a><p class="TermNum"><a name="term-playlist_ITU_G.650" id="term-playlist_ITU_G.650"></a><b>3.1.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span><b>playlist</b>:</b>Composed of a list of contents.</p>





 <div class="Note"><a name="_21e7b54a-4d58-f9e9-71b2-d37151671eea_ITU_G.650" id="_21e7b54a-4d58-f9e9-71b2-d37151671eea_ITU_G.650"></a><p class="Note"><span class="termnote_label">NOTE &#x2013; </span>This data is created and provided by digital service providers.</p></div></div>

<div><a name="term-metadata_ITU_G.650" id="term-metadata_ITU_G.650"></a><p class="TermNum"><a name="term-metadata_ITU_G.650" id="term-metadata_ITU_G.650"></a><b>3.1.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span><b>metadata</b>:</b>Structured information that pertains to the identity of users, systems, services, processes, resources, information or other entities.</p>



 </div>
</div>
    <div><a name="_b8f059cb-30ab-f1b2-947d-b7cf07152e19_ITU_G.650" id="_b8f059cb-30ab-f1b2-947d-b7cf07152e19_ITU_G.650"></a><h2>3.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span>Terms defined in this recommendation</h2>
<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e5a3a498-5d65-3b79-729e-f4f7bff7eac2_ITU_G.650" id="_e5a3a498-5d65-3b79-729e-f4f7bff7eac2_ITU_G.650"></a>This Recommendation defines the following terms:</p>
<div><a name="term-region_ITU_G.650" id="term-region_ITU_G.650"></a><p class="TermNum"><a name="term-region_ITU_G.650" id="term-region_ITU_G.650"></a><b>3.2.1.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span><b>region</b>:</b>A partial area of the screen layout to be a content displayed.</p>

 </div>

<div><a name="term-screen-layout_ITU_G.650" id="term-screen-layout_ITU_G.650"></a><p class="TermNum"><a name="term-screen-layout_ITU_G.650" id="term-screen-layout_ITU_G.650"></a><b>3.2.2.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span><b>screen layout</b>:</b>A composition of one or moreregions to be content displayed.</p>

 </div>
</div>
